In Louisville, Kentucky, hundreds of members of the Black National Guard gathered and demanded justice for Breonna Taylor, a 26-year-old black woman who was killed by police at her home last March.
The group carried firearms and marched in factions to a closed intersection where police separate the group from a group of people who protested against the protests and also carried firearms.
